  "eventSemantics": {
    "Unleashed": "An Unleashed overlay is a feat- and source-ability-gated 1-DP enhancement; it is never a separate power use.",
    "Storm": "FUCG Force Storm and Jedi Academy Force Storm have distinct definitionIds and effects.",
    "Improved Force Storm": "Requires an active FUCG Storm; swift action ends it with a 2-square 4d6 burst.",
    "Secrets": "FP and DP options are alternative exclusive resource choices and descriptor gates are validated first.",
    "Strict-defense": "Force Blast check must exceed Reflex, whereas Corruption says equals or exceeds Fortitude.",
    "Natural20": "Wrath of the Dark Side replaces, not stacks with, natural 20 suite recovery."
  },
